  "details": "I kinda want to have a setting for the camera where you can set a max distance between you and the world camera.\nIf the camera is set to world and maybe set to 10m, and you walk away over 10m, then the camera follows you in your direction. If you walk towards the camera again, it will stay in place.\nI hope you get the idea! \nI truly think that would be really awesome and helpful. \nThat would be really nice with a combination of the \"look at me\" Setting as well!",
